<article class="env-corollary" id="107173">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/107173">Corollary <span data-tag="107173">8.3.1.12</span>.</a> Let $\xymatrix {\calC  \ar @< .4ex>[r]^{F} &amp;  \calD  \ar @< .4ex>[l]^{G}}$ be a Quillen equivalence between simplicial model categories, where every object of $\calC $ is cofibrant. Suppose that $G$ is a simplicial functor. Then $G$ induces an equivalence of $\infty $-categories $\Nerve ( \calD ^{\circ }) \rightarrow \Nerve ( \calC ^{\circ })$. </p>
